sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Diagramme d'Interaction des Classes Internes : Gamification & Certification Service

    participant Ctrl as GamificationController
    participant Svc as GamificationService
    participant ProfileRepo as UserProfileRepository
    participant ProfileEnt as UserProfileGamification (Entity)
    participant CourseClient as CourseRestClient
    participant CertSvc as CertificateService
    participant CertRepo as CertificateRepository
    participant CodeConsumer as CodePassedConsumer
    participant EventPub as RabbitMQEventPublisher

    Note over CodeConsumer,EventPub: Scénario 1 : Crédit d'XP & Badge (Consommation & Publication)
    CodeConsumer->>Svc: handleCodeSolutionPassed(CodeSolutionPassedEvent)
    Svc->>ProfileRepo: findByUserId(userId)
    ProfileRepo-->>Svc: userProfile
    Svc->>ProfileEnt: addXP(+50)
    Svc->>ProfileEnt: evaluateLevelProgression()
    Svc->>ProfileRepo: save(userProfile)
    alt Si nouveau badge débloqué
        Svc->>EventPub: publishBadgeUnlockedEvent(userId, badgeId) [RabbitMQ]
    end

    Note over Svc,CertRepo: Scénario 2 : Génération Certificat (Consommation & REST Synchrone)
    Svc->>CourseClient: getCourseDetails(courseId) [REST Synchrone]
    CourseClient-->>Svc: CourseDetailsDto(title, instructorName)
    Svc->>CertSvc: generateSignedCertificate(userId, courseTitle)
    CertSvc-->>Svc: Certificate(pdfBytes, sha256Hash)
    Svc->>CertRepo: save(certificate)

    Note over Ctrl,ProfileRepo: Scénario 3 : Certification Candidat (Exposition REST Synchrone)
    Ctrl->>Svc: getCertifiedProfile(candidateId)
    Svc->>ProfileRepo: findByUserId(candidateId)
    Svc-->>Ctrl: CertifiedProfileDto(totalXP, badges, certificates)
